Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventh Episode\NThe Swan\NThe Cursed Swan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.43,0:02:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey-!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.01,0:02:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.36,0:02:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems it's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.81,0:02:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Garigori?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter Mari has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.83,0:02:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Mari?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wishing you a very Happy Birthday, Lady Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:04:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.13,0:04:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday dear Hecate,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,, I assume you all brought presents...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a lotion made by mixing goblin blood with poisonous lizard blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. Lady Hecate....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.26,0:04:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you apply it morning and night, it will make you ever so cruel and cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, eye drops filled with the rotten tears of a vulture inside the horn of a one-eyed goat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.85,0:04:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, just as you foresaw. May it grant you the power to see in the dark and see through the human heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You clueless demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:05:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only one thing I want for Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you fools not even foresee that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to put a heart into that chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.10,0:05:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire has a boy's heart in the body of a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I take that boy's heart and put it into Hecate, she will be reborn as a great witch, just as I desire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll use this swan to lure Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.74,0:05:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cursed swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find Mari?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.65,0:06:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, keep looking everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.61,0:06:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a swan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing, it's injured...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch that swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to worry about swans!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But Garigori...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If it flies, its injuries will only get worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't thrash around like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.95,0:07:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that swan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.87,0:07:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can smell it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This swan has been put under a demon's curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:08:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Angel feathers have the power to lift a demon's curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Doesn't that feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying you're not a bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.51,0:08:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A human girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.07,0:08:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're human?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was kidnapped by Mephisto the demon, and transformed into this shape by magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.66,0:08:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She says her name is Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari was turned into something like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what a shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better go tell Mr. Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.34,0:08:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa is about to go out of his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We found Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A demon's magic turned her into this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In a state like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.85,0:09:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.34,0:09:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.16,0:09:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.66,0:09:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to defeat the demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the demon's trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your destination is the Black Ghost Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.10,0:09:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.43,0:09:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.18,0:09:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:09:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.64,0:10:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.89,0:10:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if Sapphire gets caught by the demon, it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow you to tie up the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go drive the demon away, so wait in this church until I get back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,demons can't enter a church...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.39,0:10:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I have angel wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.31,0:10:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She's already growing cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The demon's magical orb absorbed Mari's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to expose that orb to the morning sun and destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:10:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get that orb!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.15,0:11:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,H...Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.19,0:11:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.16,0:11:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And... hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And... hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.30,0:11:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And... hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.16,0:11:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the way! Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of royal house of Silverland are we if we're scared of a demon or two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.71,0:11:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.70,0:11:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm borrowing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad! Bad! Bad! Bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get caught by the demon this time, it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.29,0:12:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen to Silverland if Sapphire gets taken down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all that's left is to wait for Sapphire to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.68,0:12:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dance with Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of sick...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.66,0:12:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How about drinking some poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe... That's it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this, everyone's gotten drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:12:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, that's unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:12:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Untie me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll vanquish you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.84,0:14:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, she's feeling better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mentally prepared to become a great witch, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.29,0:14:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Papa is right here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, for your sake, Papa is willing to fight against Heaven itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But... but if you do that, Papa, you'll be punished and turned back into dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.30,0:14:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I'm turned into a lump of dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's for my sweet girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that fun, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.49,0:15:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's been a while, so it was fun, Papa.
Comment: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:11.94,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Decoroasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.52,0:15:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something nice, open it up and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.91,0:15:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday to You!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday to You!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, how old is Hecate turning again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.12,0:15:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,13.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.11,0:15:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That means 13 candles!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.98,0:15:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's wonderful, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hecate, blow out the candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on! Why don't you use magic to blow them out?
Comment: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:49.48,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Mattara!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.21,0:15:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If a gust of wind won't put it out, what's next?
Comment: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:56.74,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Allerugease!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Low-flying birds, consume the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.85,0:16:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot hot hot hot hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no good, no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Any other way?
Comment: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:07.19,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Ame yo!
Comment: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:07.19,Hecate Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,O Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it rain a bit harder!
Comment: 0,0:16:11.67,0:16:12.94,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Oame yo!
Comment: 0,0:16:11.67,0:16:12.94,Hecate Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,O Heavy rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.23,0:16:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no good. Our cake is going to get ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.03,0:16:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hopeless, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're getting warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine, just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the kind of kid who could ever become a demon like Papa anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't sulk like that so easily. You need to act more like a witch—be bold and brazen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Demon King, I smell a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they arrived? Hmm, I see, I do smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've finally come, Sapphire.
Comment: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:51.82,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Shura!
Comment: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:51.82,Mephisto Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Force of Carnage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.69,0:16:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:17:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I won't let you escape, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,, Why, why did you come, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I don't want your boy's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, no, no! I want to stay just as I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool, what good will being so faint-hearted do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and lie down on the magic bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be over in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, Sapphire Prince of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's those strange wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.61,0:17:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking the magic orb!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand that over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.91,0:17:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I'd give it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.48,0:17:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.48,0:17:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.30,0:18:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lay a finger on Hecate, I, the Demon King, won't let you off easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon King, hand over the magic orb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll give Hecate back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that feather!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a swap for Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.38,0:18:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the orb!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cowardly trade!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a prince?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.82,0:18:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking—you're the one who turned poor Garigori's precious Mari into a swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Demon King, answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, take this. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.73,0:18:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, I said hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.06,0:19:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.06,0:19:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I called the bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.91,0:19:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I can hold onto insects and fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.61,0:19:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.57,0:20:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sticking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that feather...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.13,0:20:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,blow that feather up into the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, it's as good as ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.02,0:20:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.12,0:20:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, where are you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.99,0:20:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide me, okay?
Comment: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:47.60,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Hakucho ni nare.
Comment: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:47.60,Hecate Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Become a swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.34,0:20:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.44,0:20:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you hid, did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:20:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use trying to fool Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.84,0:21:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you disguise yourself as a swan, Papa can tell easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.87,0:21:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, don't make trouble for Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a demon's daughter, act like a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.04,0:21:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So as long as your own child is fine, you don't care how miserable other people become?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You stubborn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.24,0:21:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.39,0:21:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.88,0:21:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it morning already?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is strange. That shouldn't be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.72,0:21:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's wrong. It's cock-a-doodle-doo...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,, is this still no good?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.12,0:21:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too early!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too early!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.26,0:21:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid rooster!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't summon the morning! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.00,0:21:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I said shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:21:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.86,0:22:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an Angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an Angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.12,0:22:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.08,0:22:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.65,0:22:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.33,0:22:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over that orb!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.68,0:22:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.28,0:22:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I'd hand it over!\NGet away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the orb?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.11,0:22:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The orb is in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.88,0:22:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.17,0:22:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sapphire... wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.25,0:22:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.20,0:22:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.94,0:22:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,An orb in the water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.62,0:22:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.26,0:22:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If we shine the morning sun on this orb, the swan's spell will be broken, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.78,0:22:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.89,0:22:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,East is over that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.58,0:23:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.85,0:23:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute Mari!
